type: software
title: "MIRL 3D Artifact Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for visualizing and quantitatively analyzing
  3D-scanned cultural artifacts. Developed at the Material / Image
  Research Lab (MIRL), Department of History of Art & Architecture,
  University of California, Santa Barbara.
